From: smyth at wehi.EDU.AU (Gordon K Smyth)
Date: Thu, 20 Mar 2014 11:04:19 +1100 (AUS Eastern Daylight Time)
Subject: [BioC] tagwise parameters for negative binomial distribution in
	edgeR
