Here it is:

library(BiocInstaller)
pdb <- available.packages(contrib.url(biocinstallRepos()))
pkgs <- unlist(unname(package_dependencies("SomaticSignatures", db=pdb)))

Then use pkgs as the first argument to download.packages() above.
