>             elementMetadata value
>                             #     seqnames    ranges strand |   geneNames
>                             #<Rle> <IRanges> <Rle>  |<character>
>                             # [1]     chrB   [1, 20]      * |          g1
>                             # [2]     chrC   [1, 20]      * |          g2
>                             # [3]     chrB   [5, 10]      * |          g3
>                             #
>                             # seqlengths
>                             #  chrB chrC
>                             #    NA   NA
>
>                             ## can't use GRanges directly
>                             Views( myRleList, myRegions)
